{"version":1,"name":"SAVE\\SAVGAMI.DAT","data":"","leads":[{"id":"council-commissions","title":"Council commissions","detail":"Rolf says to read the proclamations at City Hall and ask the clerk about commissions."},{"id":"phlan-training-schools","title":"Training in New Phlan","detail":"Rolf showed the party where adventurers train. Return to the training schools when a character is ready to advance."},{"id":"harbor-trade","title":"The sea lanes","detail":"Rolf says few ships risk the passage and the council wants to reopen it."},{"id":"proclamation-lxiv","title":"Proclamation LXIV","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lxxviii","title":"Proclamation LXXVIII","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-cix","title":"Proclamation CIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lix","title":"Proclamation LIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"passage-sokal","title":"Passage to Sokal Keep","detail":"The harbor master says you can reach the keep by boat."},{"id":"sokal-arrival","title":"Arrival at Sokal Keep","detail":"The party landed on Thorn Island."},{"id":"sokal-reeds","title":"Reeds by the keep gate","detail":"The party saw a mound of reeds west of the gates."},{"id":"sokal-parchment","title":"The parchment at Sokal Keep","detail":"The party found a damaged scroll on a dead elf outside the keep."},{"id":"sokal-patrol-passed","title":"Sokal Keep patrol","detail":"The undead patrol accepted the word and let the party pass."},{"id":"sokal-ferran","title":"Ferran Martinez","detail":"Ferran is bound to guard the keep and asks whether Phlan has been freed."},{"id":"sokal-ambush","title":"Sokal courtyard ambush","detail":"A large force of orcs and hobgoblins rushed the party through the courtyard door."},{"id":"sokal-courtyard-note","title":"Note from the courtyard","detail":"The party found a note on a fallen hobgoblin and copied it as journal entry 57."},{"id":"sokal-chapel","title":"Sokal Keep chapel","detail":"The party found the remains of two orcs in the doorway and a large altar against the south wall."},{"id":"sokal-pale-form","title":"The keep's pale figure","detail":"A pale figure appeared inside the keep. The party can try speaking to it."},{"id":"sokal-phlan-fall","title":"Ferran's account of Phlan's fall","detail":"Ferran said creatures empowered by a magical pool overran Phlan. He named Tyranthraxus, Edranka, and Torath as their leaders."},{"id":"sokal-mendor","title":"Mendor's lost histories","detail":"Ferran says Mendor gathered accounts of the powers that brought down Phlan. His library was overrun."},{"id":"sokal-armory","title":"Sokal Keep armory","detail":"Ferran says help lies beyond an illusory wall in the armory."},{"id":"sokal-departure","title":"Ferran's password","detail":"Ferran told the party to say SAMOSUD to his guards on the way out."},{"id":"journal-entry-57","title":"Journal entry 57","detail":"The party encountered a reference to entry 57 in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"sokal-return-pier","title":"Boat back from Thorn Island","detail":"The party found a boat returning to New Phlan at the south pier."},{"id":"commission-slums","title":"Clear the Slums - in progress","detail":"Keep clearing encounters in the Slums until the district is secure. 1 of 25 encounters cleared.","status":"accepted","clearedEncounters":1},{"id":"commission-sokal","title":"Clear Sokal Keep - turned in","detail":"The council acknowledged the result.","status":"turned-in"},{"id":"commission-records","title":"Recover records of old Phlan - offered","detail":"Search the old city for historical records and bring worthwhile finds to the clerk.","status":"offered"},{"id":"commission-auction","title":"Investigate the auction - turned in","detail":"The council acknowledged the result.","status":"turned-in"},{"id":"harbor-routes-reopened","title":"The harbor routes are open","detail":"The harbor master offers passage east, west, back to Sokal Keep, and to the north side of the bay."},{"id":"phlan-return-ferry","title":"Return ferry to New Phlan","detail":"Choose Take Boat at the dock to return to the civilized part of Phlan."},{"id":"auction-plaza-entry","title":"The crowd at Podal Plaza","detail":"The party can disguise itself as monsters or sneak past the crowd."},{"id":"auction-started","title":"The auction has begun","detail":"The auctioneer announced a powerful magical item to the crowd."},{"id":"auction-plaza-approach-chosen","title":"An approach to the auction","detail":"The party chose how to cross the crowd at Podal Plaza."},{"id":"auction-bidding","title":"The high bid","detail":"A man in plain clothes standing next to an ogre bid 5,000 gold pieces."},{"id":"auction-exchange","title":"The auction exchange","detail":"The party saw a man and an ogre exchange the wand and a large bag before disappearing into the crowd."},{"id":"commission-textile","title":"Recover Cadorna's treasure - turned in","detail":"Cadorna's treasure affair is settled.","status":"turned-in"},{"id":"textile-courtyard-ambush","title":"Textile House courtyard ambush","detail":"A drum sounded as hobgoblins attacked the party in the courtyard."},{"id":"textile-courtyard-cleared","title":"Textile House courtyard cleared","detail":"The drum fell silent after the party defeated the courtyard hobgoblins."},{"id":"textile-ogre-chief","title":"The hobgoblins' chief","detail":"The party found the ogre chief in a torchlit room beyond the secret door."},{"id":"textile-iron-box","title":"Cadorna's sealed iron box","detail":"The family seal across the lock will break if the party opens the box."},{"id":"textile-handoff","title":"The Watch took Cadorna's treasure","detail":"The Watch sent the party to the city clerk to collect its reward."},{"id":"commission-bane","title":"Follow up with the Temple of Tyr - offered","detail":"Speak with Bishop Braccio at Tyr's temple about his summons.","status":"offered"},{"id":"kovel-chase","title":"Thieves in Kovel Mansion","detail":"Two thieves fled through the east door after their attack failed."},{"id":"kovel-thieves-split","title":"The thieves split up","detail":"One ran east and the other ran south."},{"id":"kovel-thief-ambush","title":"Mansion ambush","detail":"Thieves attacked the party inside the mansion."},{"id":"kovel-thief-ambush-cleared","title":"Mansion ambush cleared","detail":"The party defeated the thieves who set the ambush."},{"id":"nomad-camp-found","title":"The Nomad Camp","detail":"The party found a camp on the overland route and can choose Enter or Leave."},{"id":"nomad-swords-ready","title":"The camp is on guard","detail":"The nomads held their swords ready and watched the party. More emerged from the tents."},{"id":"nomad-sentries","title":"The nomads wait","detail":"The nomads are watching the party and waiting to see how it approaches them."},{"id":"nomad-feast-invitation","title":"The headman's invitation","detail":"The headman invited the party to a feast in its honor."},{"id":"nomad-feast-attended","title":"Honored guests at the Nomad Camp","detail":"The party accepted the invitation and the nomads held contests of strength and skill in its honor."},{"id":"nomad-headman-talk","title":"Hassad Ahwal's account","detail":"The headman described the region's dangers. The party recorded his account as journal entry 55."},{"id":"nomad-kobold-warning","title":"The headman fears a raid","detail":"The headman's scouts found signs of kobolds nearby. He asked the party to stay until they pass."},{"id":"nomad-stay-or-leave","title":"Stay or leave the camp","detail":"The headman asked the party for its answer. The choices are Stay and Fight or Leave."},{"id":"nomad-declined-aid","title":"The party declined to stay","detail":"The headman wished the party well after it chose to leave."},{"id":"kobold-cave-fork","title":"The kobold cave fork","detail":"The party found a concealed cave beside a larger entrance and can choose which to explore."},{"id":"kobold-throne-envoys","title":"Envoys at the throne","detail":"The party found two envoys at the kobold throne."},{"id":"kobold-king-ballista","title":"The king's concealed ballistae","detail":"The kobold king ordered his guards to fire concealed ballistae in the throne room."},{"id":"kobold-king-escaped","title":"The king escaped","detail":"The kobold king slipped away during the fight at the throne."},{"id":"kobold-king-secret-door","title":"Secret door in the north wall","detail":"The party found a hidden door in the kobold caves after the king escaped."},{"id":"kobold-king-quarters","title":"The king's quarters","detail":"The party reached the king's quarters and encountered his guards."},{"id":"kobold-king-fell","title":"The kobold king fell","detail":"The king panicked, fell into his own spiked pit, and died."}],"party":{"SAVE\\CHRDATI1.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI1.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBAEsAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI1.SPC":"WgAA/wAIALw5YQAA/wAIAIg8GgAA/wAIAJI8LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI2.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI2.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBAEsAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI2.SPC":"WgAA/wAIAKo8YQAA/wAIAKs8GgAA/wAIAKw8LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI3.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI3.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBAEsAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI3.SPC":"WgAA/wAIAMQ8YQAA/wAIAMU8GgAA/wAIAMY8LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI4.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI4.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBAEsAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI4.SPC":"WgAA/wAIAN48YQAA/wAIAN88GgAA/wAIAOA8LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATI5.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATI5.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBAEsAAAAA"